# The commands no earlier phase ported: scan (scan.c), flag (flags.c), areas (db.c), commands and wizhelp
# (interp.c), with Planner (56) and Delver (a mortal), in Midgaard.
# - scan all around and each way, three rooms deep (the "Looking ... you see:" line is never sent), and a word
#   that isn't a direction
# - commands for a mortal and an immortal; wizhelp; areas, with and without an argument
# - flag: each refusal, then toggling, adding (+), removing (-) and setting (=) a mob's act flags, which stat mob
#   shows; a sign stuck to the flag's name takes the name with it; a player's plr and comm flags; a first word
#   that's neither mob nor char does nothing
@connect b
Planner
smoke123
@return
@return
scroll 0
goto 3014
scan
scan north
scan south
scan e
scan up
scan sideways
@connect d
Delver
psswrd
@return
scroll 0
commands
scan
@as b
commands
wizhelp
areas
areas please
goto 3001
flag
flag mob
flag mob hassan
flag mob hassan act
flag mob nobody act sentinel
flag mob hassan act bogus
flag mob hassan bogus sentinel
flag mob hassan plr holylight
flag char delver act sentinel
flag char delver form edible
flag char delver parts ear
flag mob hassan comm quiet
flag mob hassan act sentinel
stat mob hassan
flag mob hassan act + aggressive
stat mob hassan
flag mob hassan act - aggressive sentinel
stat mob hassan
flag mob hassan act = sentinel
stat mob hassan
flag mob hassan act +aggressive
flag mob hassan aff sanctuary
flag mob hassan resist fire
flag mob hassan vuln cold
flag mob hassan immunity acid
stat mob hassan
flag char delver plr + holylight
flag char delver comm + quiet
stat char delver
flag bogus hassan act sentinel
